     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與學歷",
      "en": "Birth and education"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "斯托爾貝里生於1865年，地點是蘇奧穆薩爾米；他1884年成為大學新生，1887年取得哲學候補學位，1889年取得法學候補學位，1892年取得代理法官資格，1893年取得法學博士。德國國家圖書館權威檔也記他生於1865年。",
      "en": "Ståhlberg was born in 1865 in Suomussalmi; he matriculated in 1884, took a candidate degree in philosophy in 1887 and a candidate degree in law in 1889, qualified as a deputy judge (varatuomari) in 1892, and gained a doctorate in law in 1893. The German National Library authority record also gives 1865 as his birth year."
     },
