     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "官職、學術與社會工作",
      "en": "Official, academic and civic work"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1893至1903年間他任參議院民政處的紀要秘書，後來被以行政途徑免職；1894至1898年他在赫爾辛基大學擔任行政法與國民經濟的助理，1903至1905年任手工業與工廠協會秘書，1905至1907年擔任參議院經濟部商工處的首長。",
      "en": "From 1893 to 1903 he was protocol secretary of the Senate civil office and was later dismissed by administrative means; from 1894 to 1898 he was an assistant in administrative law and national economy at the University of Helsinki, from 1903 to 1905 secretary of the Handicraft and Factory Association, and from 1905 to 1907 head of the trade and industry commission of the Senate economic division."
     },
