    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1908-01-01",
      "end": "1920-01-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "教授、議員與最高行政法院院長",
      "en": "Professor, member of parliament and chief justice"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1908至1918年他在赫爾辛基大學擔任行政法教授；議會資料記他1908年8月1日至1910年2月28日代表海梅省南部選區、1914年2月2日至1918年8月10日代表奧盧省南部選區，兩屆都隸屬青年芬蘭黨。1914年2月3日至1917年4月3日他任議長；1918年8月10日他轉任最高行政法院院長，議會資料記此職為1918至1919年。",
      "en": "From 1908 to 1918 he was professor of administrative law at the University of Helsinki. Parliament records show him sitting for the southern Häme constituency from 1 August 1908 to 28 February 1910 and for the southern Oulu constituency from 2 February 1914 to 10 August 1918, both terms under the Young Finnish Party. He was Speaker from 3 February 1914 to 3 April 1917 and on 10 August 1918 he moved to become president of the Supreme Administrative Court, a post the parliament record dates 1918–1919."
     },
