    {
     "ord": 4,
     "period": {
      "start": "1919-01-01",
      "end": "1953-01-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "總統任期與晚年",
      "en": "Presidency and later years"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "總統府官網列他為1919至1925年的總統；德國國家圖書館權威檔同樣記他1919至1925年任國家元首。1926至1945年他是法律準備委員會的資深成員，1930年10月21日至1933年8月31日又代表烏西馬省選區，這次隸屬國民進步黨；他1952年卒於赫爾辛基。",
      "en": "The President's Office lists him as president for 1919–1925, and the German National Library authority record likewise gives 1919–1925 as his years as head of state. From 1926 to 1945 he was a senior member of the law preparation committee, and from 21 October 1930 to 31 August 1933 he again sat for the Uusimaa constituency, this time for the National Progressive Party; he died in Helsinki in 1952."
     },
